usage: main.py [-h]
               {experiment-list,preflight,artifact-list,experiment-refresh,reports-refresh,eda,baseline,compare,validate,submit,predict,report,deep,aux-boost,deep-summary,verify,feature-select,feature-optimize,feature-evidence,common-models,canonical-submit,project-review,model-search,source-audit,aux-ablation,economic-signals,economic-ablation,group-temporal,spatial-controls,spatiotemporal,tabm,relu,all}
               ...

CS5228 HDB rent: EDA, experiments, temporal validation and submission

positional arguments:
  {experiment-list,preflight,artifact-list,experiment-refresh,reports-refresh,eda,baseline,compare,validate,submit,predict,report,deep,aux-boost,deep-summary,verify,feature-select,feature-optimize,feature-evidence,common-models,canonical-submit,project-review,model-search,source-audit,aux-ablation,economic-signals,economic-ablation,group-temporal,spatial-controls,spatiotemporal,tabm,relu,all}
    experiment-list     List local experiment modules without running them
    preflight           Check resources without importing models, installing
                        or training
    artifact-list       List current model files, fusion parameters and metric
                        references without loading models
    experiment-refresh (reports-refresh)
                        Refresh selected experiment summaries from existing
                        results; no training
    eda                 Run consolidated EDA into one experiment/eda tree
    baseline            Reproduce the mean and CatBoost A/B/C feature
                        comparison
    compare             Compare Ridge, Random Forest, CatBoost and LightGBM
    validate            Time validation with monthly, town and flat-type
                        errors
    submit              Refit and write Id,Predicted; does not upload to
                        Kaggle
    predict             Generate predictions using a saved submit-command
                        artifact
    report              Rebuild the preserved EDA progress PDF
    deep                Train a GPU tabular deep-learning experiment
    aux-boost           Train the auxiliary LightGBM benchmark
    deep-summary        Summarize deep models and rebuild ensembles
    verify              Audit environment and saved-result consistency
    feature-select      Compare feature policies with one LightGBM model and
                        fixed-origin folds
    feature-optimize    Audit redundancy and test causal history and market
                        representations
    feature-evidence    Retrain single-column/group deletions and report
                        temporal error diagnostics
    common-models       Compare architectures with the same 27 feature inputs
                        and outer training rows
    canonical-submit    Refit the fixed 27-feature LightGBM baseline and
                        export locally (no upload)
    project-review      Build the current project report and evidence index
                        from completed results
    model-search        Nested temporal comparison of tree and official neural
                        models
    source-audit        Audit overlap with public HDB rental disclosures,
                        separate from forecasting
    aux-ablation        Run staged spatial/economic feature ablation
    economic-signals    Run prior-month economic signal analysis
    economic-ablation   Compare engineered economic features
    group-temporal      Run grouped temporal panel analysis
    spatial-controls    Run spatial overview, fixed-effect and matching
                        studies
    spatiotemporal      Run expanding-window historical/spatial forecasts
    tabm                Run the TabM-style neural/tree experiment
    relu                Run nested-validation sklearn ReLU MLP
    all                 Run all EDA, both historical experiments and the PDF
                        report

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
